#: ../../start-here.rst:165
#: 11f04e3e87834f4ab4bbd247abc61554
msgid "Working"
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:167
#: 0675f22583ed4883b74f0f4c9579cfba
msgid "There is a very simple workflow for Diátaxis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:171
#: 84b202e6a25d453f87d012a6b0824bb2
msgid ":ref:`how-to-use-diataxis`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:173
#: 434e18e7c6fc4cbbb8edfd5b91bdb1f8
msgid "Consider what you see in the documentation, in front of you right now (which might be literally nothing, if you haven't started yet)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:175
#: ebaf3a42bcfa4a3db6927981fd2563af
msgid "Ask: *is there any way in which it could be improved?*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:177
#: ac72402c94de4d84aee4960d3c8c224c
msgid "Decide on *one* thing you could do to it right now, however small, that would improve it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:179
#: 2f7bf9e7c1c94623bdfca71c38286bfa
msgid "Do that thing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:181
#: 7f2bc19599484cb1b0d75a0910082157
msgid "And then repeat."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:183
#: 818391d55d06478188b1b9cc42cb377b
msgid "That's it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:189
#: f70dc30ceeb843d3b34bd2258306ad6a
msgid "Do what you like"
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:191
#: 8bc687b4fd5649abbe6f1b1997f15f3f
msgid "You can do what you like with Diátaxis. You don't have to believe in it and there is no exam. It is a wholly pragmatic approach. I think it's *true*, but what matters is that it actually helps people create better documentation. If you find one idea or insight in it that seems to be worthwhile, help yourself to that."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:193
#: 11b5a4353043425bb5984d85e510ccb5
msgid "There is an extensively elaborated theory around Diátaxis, but you don't need to subscribe to it, or even read about it. Diátaxis doesn't require a commitment to pursue it to a final end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:195
#: 2c3bdba61c164a55af548143370dc2f5
msgid "You can do just one thing, right now, and even if you do nothing else ever after, you will at least have made that one improvement. (In practice what you will find is that each thing you do will give you a clue as to the next thing to do - you only need to keep doing them.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:199
#: 755ed747a56145c4a3a8f501a29362f4
msgid "Get started"
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:201
#: 8e0a68680ad24bb0be637f13d37f16f1
msgid "At this point, you have read everything you need to get started with Diátaxis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../start-here.rst:203
#: abc2deb9f16440f59eb93b677d2baaf5
msgid "You can read more if you want, and eventually you probably should, but *you will get the most value from the guidance in this website when you turn to it with a problem or a question*. That's when it comes alive."
msgstr ""
